[en.DECISION_C23_MANEHATTAN_ASSIST_IN_COMMANDING]
Assist in Commanding

[en.DECISION_C23_MANEHATTAN_ASSIST_IN_COMMANDING_desc]
Sunset shimmer will assist Starlight in commanding the front-line forces of the Resistance.

[zh.DECISION_C23_MANEHATTAN_ASSIST_IN_COMMANDING]
协助指挥

[zh.DECISION_C23_MANEHATTAN_ASSIST_IN_COMMANDING_desc]
余晖烁烁将协助星光熠熠指挥抵抗军前线部队。
